.TH swarm-status-peers 1  "swarm 0.2.1" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-status\-peers \- Peers known for each repo, and which are connected
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm status peers\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIREPO\fR] 
